From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:54:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(ui): Debug info window with a Copy button, opened
 from the status strip

A bug glyph at the status strip's right end opens a "Debug info" window:
version and build, OS/arch, GPU adapter, project path, units, machine,
document counts with operation status and the last status line, as
plain text with a Copy button. The shell snapshots move by the new
glyph only.

Fixes #157

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
